{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/6c0403bd9b8ec7170ff6b86b5aaaac5c.webp?t=1762690002\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Emptiness comes alive with vivid colors, symbolizing the player\u2019s emotions and experiences. Colors alter the physical properties of objects, revealing new paths to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/0214a7c36a3cbf43734c99a041082c2e.poster.avif?t=1762690002\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/0214a7c36a3cbf43734c99a041082c2e.webm?t=1762690002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/0214a7c36a3cbf43734c99a041082c2e.mp4?t=1762690002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/f4b0eb863301fdeb7932492902cb861b.webp?t=1762690002\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character \u2014 the \u201cUnborn\u201d \u2014 is a dark, living being devoid of life, without features or distortions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/2f7e71965d56284a11b9b1bd6b72f242.poster.avif?t=1762690002\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/2f7e71965d56284a11b9b1bd6b72f242.webm?t=1762690002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/2f7e71965d56284a11b9b1bd6b72f242.mp4?t=1762690002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/956435937c82f91d7e409c186d2b5583.webp?t=1762690002\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist encounters souls that have rejected self-discovery and turned into sources of darkness, feeding on other souls.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/54cfb74730d1c1195d10812c2f6b1ccd.poster.avif?t=1762690002\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/54cfb74730d1c1195d10812c2f6b1ccd.webm?t=1762690002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/54cfb74730d1c1195d10812c2f6b1ccd.mp4?t=1762690002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/835663e1e1f18d370ccb61e0b391e538.webp?t=1762690002\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features elements from &lt;i&gt;HOOK&lt;/i&gt; by Maciej Targoni, seamlessly integrated into &lt;i&gt;Emptiness&lt;/i&gt; to enrich its puzzles and create a truly unique experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/a495e68265188e20cdde8538d2d82f89.poster.avif?t=1762690002\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/a495e68265188e20cdde8538d2d82f89.webm?t=1762690002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/a495e68265188e20cdde8538d2d82f89.mp4?t=1762690002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/fd2527b46a73345ac6173f5fd9b0c518.webp?t=1762690002\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into &lt;i&gt;Emptiness&lt;/i&gt;: a blend of puzzles, platforming, and dark souls seeking their path through the spirit world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/777a789346bbb2d479284d3954c49815.poster.avif?t=1762690002\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/777a789346bbb2d479284d3954c49815.webm?t=1762690002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/777a789346bbb2d479284d3954c49815.mp4?t=1762690002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/1e8439036243bef8a238a7800afc2aee.webp?t=1762690002\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;i&gt;Emptiness&lt;/i&gt; uses minimalist pixel art to convey meaning through symbols and gestures, making the game universally accessible.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/61459fac23e2dd0cce506af7eb7afdd8.gif?t=1762690002\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/61459fac23e2dd0cce506af7eb7afdd8.poster.avif?t=1762690002\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/692a757d064aedabb81b03a7f8eaba78.webp?t=1762690002\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;i&gt;Emptiness&lt;/i&gt; is a journey into the fourth dimension, where souls take forms that reflect their past lives.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/d6d4c4e5fe4de447f979a1e763050b1b.poster.avif?t=1762690002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/d6d4c4e5fe4de447f979a1e763050b1b.webm?t=1762690002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/caabb111b4cd8dcc31b20b883d425d24.webp?t=1762690002\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the difficulty grows, new puzzles emerge, unveiling the hidden secrets of the void.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/0c3b6e825bdc670c97510b3bb4453c9a.poster.avif?t=1762690002\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/0c3b6e825bdc670c97510b3bb4453c9a.webm?t=1762690002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/0c3b6e825bdc670c97510b3bb4453c9a.mp4?t=1762690002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/8bf85c63a95ff57affec7aacef75b5cd.webp?t=1762690002\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character knows nothing of the world \u2014 platforms vanish, yet color enhances perception and memory.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/f67f8c962381749351f23bca9cfd1e7c.poster.avif?t=1762690002\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/f67f8c962381749351f23bca9cfd1e7c.webm?t=1762690002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/c8eff0c13767c41ec2d48b297b42fb71.webp?t=1762690002\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All our games exist within a single universe, united by three interconnected stories. &lt;i&gt;Emptiness&lt;/i&gt; is a key part that completes the larger picture.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/4637049ad6aff5e1d7b3cf2c31907634.avif?t=1762690002\" width=1232 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A journey from nothingness to nowhere \u2014 an immersive experience of the world and its mysterious inhabitants.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2761760?t=1762690002","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762690002","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/d45963045af1218bf85db3b6349229a1b50a9a0c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762690002","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/d45963045af1218bf85db3b6349229a1b50a9a0c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762690002","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/6c0403bd9b8ec7170ff6b86b5aaaac5c.webp?t=1762690002\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Emptiness comes alive with vivid colors, symbolizing the player\u2019s emotions and experiences. Colors alter the physical properties of objects, revealing new paths to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/0214a7c36a3cbf43734c99a041082c2e.poster.avif?t=1762690002\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/0214a7c36a3cbf43734c99a041082c2e.webm?t=1762690002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/0214a7c36a3cbf43734c99a041082c2e.mp4?t=1762690002\" type=\"video/mp