xtras/d6d4c4e5fe4de447f979a1e763050b1b.webm?t=1762690002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/caabb111b4cd8dcc31b20b883d425d24.webp?t=1762690002\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the difficulty grows, new puzzles emerge, unveiling the hidden secrets of the void.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/0c3b6e825bdc670c97510b3bb4453c9a.poster.avif?t=1762690002\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/0c3b6e825bdc670c97510b3bb4453c9a.webm?t=1762690002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/0c3b6e825bdc670c97510b3bb4453c9a.mp4?t=1762690002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/8bf85c63a95ff57affec7aacef75b5cd.webp?t=1762690002\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character knows nothing of the world \u2014 platforms vanish, yet color enhances perception and memory.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/f67f8c962381749351f23bca9cfd1e7c.poster.avif?t=1762690002\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/f67f8c962381749351f23bca9cfd1e7c.webm?t=1762690002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/c8eff0c13767c41ec2d48b297b42fb71.webp?t=1762690002\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All our games exist within a single universe, united by three interconnected stories. &lt;i&gt;Emptiness&lt;/i&gt; is a key part that completes the larger picture.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/4637049ad6aff5e1d7b3cf2c31907634.avif?t=1762690002\" width=1232 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A journey from nothingness to nowhere \u2014 an immersive experience of the world and its mysterious inhabitants.</i></p>","developers":["GentFish"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/header.jpg?t=1762690002","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.12 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> any card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2761760/743816/c2defbc3305de9dabf4392b07d9f279b953cfcb0/1750897760/dash_av1.mpd?t=1724253887","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2761760/743816/c2defbc3305de9dabf4392b07d9f279b953cfcb0/1750897760/dash_h264.mpd?t=1724253887","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2761760/743816/c2defbc3305de9dabf4392b07d9f279b953cfcb0/1750897760/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1724253887","id":257048243,"name":"E